{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">重慶彭水發生山泥傾瀉，多間房屋倒塌，至今救出八人。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">網上片段見到，事發一刻，多名市民慌忙逃生。事後見到大量泥沙及巨石，砸毀下方多棟房屋。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.LANDSLIDE-1330_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026J4qJjk7mgQ1784275336.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CN.LANDSLIDE-1330_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">現場是彭水漢葭街道、烏江三橋附近。當地人員上午發現山上有零星落石後啟動緊急預警，但疏散期間山泥傾瀉，部分人被埋。應急管理部調度過百名救援人員到場搜救。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.LANDSLIDE-1330.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026oiY6puO1Mf1784275260.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CN.LANDSLIDE-1330.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-17T08:21:09.898557+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}